WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Nosetsa bethe hantle pele o beha mulch.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Hasanya mahlaka a ommeng kapa mulch e nngwe e mahwashe hodima mobu.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Beha mulch e mahwashe botebo ba 5 ho isa ho 10 cm. Beha mokato o mosesane wa jwang bo kutilweng.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Siya sebaka se ka bang 5 cm ho potoloha dikutu tsa meroho hore di ome.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Pula e monyela mobung o kwahetsweng. Mulch e etsa hore mongobo o dule nako e telele.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Tlatsa mulch ha e ntse e bola, mme o boloke sebaka ho potoloha dikutu.
